{"version":1,"content":"<p>持續困擾國際空間站多年的空氣泄漏問題似乎終於迎來了最終解決方案。多家航天領域消息顯示，位於國際空間站俄羅斯「星辰」號服務艙尾部的PrK轉運通道已被決定永久關閉。由於長期存在且無法徹底修復的裂縫，該通道未來將不再承擔人員進入和貨物卸載任務，俄羅斯貨運飛船的運營方式也將因此發生重大調整。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584832.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:23.220277+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:35:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.410609+00:00","content_hash":"ba92746bbfba9ba635b4bc96907576020bc68ae7bf9e28765b96ee4220c4ce18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}